      "content": "i mean i know i should talk to my doctor but i have a massive meeting tomorrow and i cant afford to be unfocused. its probably just the hyperthyroidism making me feel extra sensitive to the stimulant right? like if i just take my normal dose it should be fine, right? it's not like it's gonna do anything serious if i just push through it for one day?",
